    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "blue morpho butterfly",
            "zh": "蓝闪蝶"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is an unusual creature. Its wings can "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "reflect",
            "ref": "v-reflect"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " light and produce a bright blue colour from many "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "angles",
            "ref": "v-angle"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Wang Wanlin and his team at Shenzhen University noticed this wonder of "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "—and they’ve looked beyond the beauty."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The team came up with a possible answer to a modern problem: how to keep our cars cool without "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a sense of beauty."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In response, the team designed a thin-film type. It acts like the reflective "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "paints",
            "ref": "v-paint"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on the market, but there is a key "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ": This one offers many bright colours."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "coating",
            "zh": "涂层"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " has three layers. The "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " layer is made from "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "titanium",
            "zh": "钛"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "silicon",
            "zh": "硅"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and oxygen. The two underneath are made from special glass and a thin silver mirror. The glass layer has small "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "structures",
            "ref": "v-structure"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that give it a look just like the blue butterfly wings."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When a material takes in light, its temperature "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". That’s why, on a sunny day, the interior of a car can feel like an oven. The team’s idea was to design the film to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "scatter",
            "ref": "v-scatter"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " light, thereby creating a "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " effect. And they didn’t stop there. They also figured out how to control reflection to change the coating’s colour."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Wang and his colleagues made coating samples in several colours. They put them under the burning sun for about seven hours. The researchers kept an eye on their "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They found that all the samples remained about 2℃ cooler than the surrounding air. Their cooling power became more obvious when the researchers tested them "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on a car. A car that used traditional blue paint reached 75℃. The team’s sample piece managed to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a temperature of around 42℃."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Wang hopes the new coating will soon be used to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " electric vehicles. “It could greatly reduce the energy use of electric vehicle air conditioning, thereby increasing the vehicle’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "mileage",
            "zh": "行驶里程"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ",” he says."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
